Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and potential usages  
• PUBLICATIONS."publication_number": uniquely identifies each patent document and lets us find US‑9741766‑B2.  
• PUBLICATIONS."filing_date": numeric (YYYYMMDD) field we can substring to obtain the filing year that other patents must share.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."publication_number": join key matching the publications table.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."embedding_v1": VARIANT array containing the pretrained Google patent‑text embedding we will use to compute cosine‑style (dot‑product) similarity.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."cpc", ABS_AND_EMB."cpc_inventive_low": optional technology tags for ad‑hoc inspection / filtering.

Typical conditions  
• PUBLICATIONS."publication_number" = 'US‑9741766‑B2' — locate the focal patent.  
• TO_NUMBER(SUBSTR(PUBLICATIONS."filing_date",1,4)) = <focal_year> — restrict to patents filed the same year.  
• ABS_AND_EMB."publication_number" IS NOT NULL AND ABS_AND_EMB."embedding_v1" IS NOT NULL — keep records that have usable embeddings.  

Below are 10 incrementally more complex Snowflake SQL queries (LIMIT 20 each) that explore the data and culminate in a query retrieving the five most‑similar patents.  
All identifiers are double‑quoted and comments start with --.

```sql
-- 1. Description: basic look‑up of the focal patent in the PUBLICATIONS table
SELECT *
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS"
WHERE "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: retrieve only publication number and filing date for the focal patent
SELECT 
    "publication_number",
    "filing_date"
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS"
WHERE "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: show the embedding record of the focal patent
SELECT 
    "publication_number",
    "embedding_v1"
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."ABS_AND_EMB"
WHERE "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: inspect a few raw embedding coordinates via FLATTEN for the focal patent
SELECT 
    f.index AS "coord_index",
    f.value::FLOAT AS "coord_value"
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."ABS_AND_EMB" t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."embedding_v1") f
WHERE t."publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: list patents (publication numbers) that share the same filing year as the focal patent
SELECT DISTINCT 
    p."publication_number"
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS" p
JOIN ( SELECT TO_NUMBER(SUBSTR("filing_date",1,4)) AS "yr"
       FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS"
       WHERE "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
       LIMIT 1 ) yr_tbl
  ON TO_NUMBER(SUBSTR(p."filing_date",1,4)) = yr_tbl."yr"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: count how many same‑year patents actually have embeddings
SELECT COUNT(*) AS "with_embeddings"
FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."ABS_AND_EMB" ae
JOIN "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS" p
  ON ae."publication_number" = p."publication_number"
JOIN ( SELECT TO_NUMBER(SUBSTR("filing_date",1,4)) AS "yr"
       FROM "PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PATENTS_GOOGLE"."PUBLICATIONS"
       WHERE "publication_number" = 'US-9741766-B2'
       LIMIT 1 ) yr_tbl
  ON TO_NUMBER(SUBSTR(p."filing_date",1,4)) = yr_tbl."yr"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
